# Release signing -- never commit the keystore password or the keystore
# file itself. keystore.properties.example (checked in) shows the shape;
# keystore.properties (this file, real values) stays local-only. The
# actual .jks lives outside this repo entirely, at
# ~/.android-keystores/deepxi/ -- the *.jks/*.keystore patterns below are
# defense in depth in case that convention isn't followed later.
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
